---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<Page title="Privacy policy" metaTitle="Privacy Policy | SpiceVacations" description="How SpiceVacations.com collects, uses and protects your data: contact messages, newsletter sign-ups, consent-based analytics and your privacy rights." updated="September 25, 2026">
  <p>This policy explains what information SpiceVacations.com ("we," "us") collects, why, and the choices you have. We keep data collection to a minimum.</p>
  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <h3>Information you give us</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Contact form:</strong> your name, email address, topic and message, so we can reply.</li>
    <li><strong>Newsletter:</strong> your email address and the page where you signed up.</li>
    <li><strong>Plan My Vacation:</strong> your answers are processed to generate recommendations and are not stored with your identity.</li>
  </ul>
  <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Essential technical data:</strong> our hosting provider (Cloudflare) processes IP addresses and request data to deliver and secure the site, for example for rate limiting and abuse prevention. We store only a one-way hash of IP addresses for rate limiting.</li>
    <li><strong>Affiliate click counts:</strong> when you use a "Check Availability" link we count the click per link and day. We do not attach personal data to these counts.</li>
    <li><strong>Analytics (only with consent):</strong> if you accept analytics cookies, we may use privacy-focused analytics to understand which pages are useful.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To reply to messages and send the newsletter you requested.</li>
    <li>To operate, secure and improve the site.</li>
    <li>To understand, in aggregate, which guides and partners are helpful.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information, and we do not share it for cross-context behavioral advertising.</p>
  <h2>Affiliate partners</h2>
  <p>When you click to a partner site, that partner may set its own cookies to attribute your booking. Their privacy policies apply on their sites.</p>
  <h2>Retention</h2>
  <p>Contact messages are kept for up to 180 days. Newsletter subscriptions are kept until you unsubscribe or ask us to delete them.</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Depending on where you live (including under laws such as the California Consumer Privacy Act), you may have the right to access, correct or
    delete your personal information and to opt out of certain processing. Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> and we'll respond
    within 30 days. We will not discriminate against you for exercising your rights.
  </p>
  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This site is intended for adults. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.</p>
  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>We use HTTPS, strict security headers, server-side validation and rate limiting to protect the site and the information you send us.</p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We will update this page if our practices change and revise the "last updated" date above.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions? Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
</Page>
